  "texts": {
    "preamble": "K.Alaguraja vs The Commissioner on 14 August, 2024 Author: Mohammed Shaffiq Bench: Mohammed Shaffiq W.P(MD)No.5941 BEFORE THE MADURAI BENCH OF MADRAS HIGH COURT Dated: 14.08.2024 CORAM THE HONOURABLE MR JUSTICE MOHAMMED SHAFFIQ W.P(MD)No.5941 of 2024 and W.M.P(MD)No.5595 of 2024 K.Alaguraja ... Petit Vs. 1.The Commissioner, Food Safety Department, 5th Annasalai, 359, Annasalai, Chennai-600 006. 2.The District Collector, Madurai District, Madurai. 3.The Designated Officer, Food Safety Department, Food Safety Wing, Madurai District. 4.The Food Safety Officer, Madurai District, 1 https://www.mhc.tn.gov.in/judis W.P(MD)No.5941 of 5.The Inspector of Police, K.Alaguraja vs The Commissioner on 14 August, 2024 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/42691903/ 1 Anna Nagar, Madurai District. ...Respondents Prayer: Writ Petition is filed under Article 226 of the Consti of India, praying for the issuance of a Writ of Certiorarified Mandamus, calling for the records of the 3rd respondent dated 04.03.2024 in proceedings Na.Ka.No.0314/2024/vu.paa.thu and quash the same as the same is arbitrary ultraries and consequentially direct the respondents to remove the lock and of the petitioner's petty shop in Door No.197A, Vaigai Colony, Annanagar, Madurai-625 020 and permit the petitioner to carry the business in the premises. For Petitioner : Mr.S.Senthil Kumar For R1 to R4 : Mr.J.K.Jayaselan, Government Advocate For R5 : Mr.Vaikkam Karunanithi Addl. Government Pleade ORDER",
